sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant T as Token Contract<br/>(ERC20)
    participant P as LendingPool<br/>(Spender)

    Note over U,P: STEP 1: User Approve Token
    
    U->>T: approve(LendingPool, 1000 DAI)
    T->>T: allowance[user][pool] = 1000
    T-->>U: ✅ Approved
    
    Note over U,P: STEP 2: User Supply Token
    
    U->>P: lend(DAI, 1000)
    P->>T: transferFrom(user, pool, 1000)
    T->>T: Check: allowance >= 1000? ✅
    T->>T: balance[user] -= 1000
    T->>T: balance[pool] += 1000
    T->>T: allowance[user][pool] -= 1000
    T-->>P: ✅ Transfer successful
    P-->>U: ✅ Supply successful

    Note over U,P: State After:
    Note over T: User Balance: 0 DAI<br/>Pool Balance: 1000 DAI<br/>Allowance: 0 DAI


